( Static phreatic level without a pressure unknown, audit cluster K22.
  Pro test other/ground18: a 1 x 100 soil column (top y=0, bottom
  y=-100), gravity 10, groundflow_density 1, wet/dry densities 2.0/1.5,
  groundflow_phreatic_level -50 with groundflow_phreatic_level_static
  -yes and group_type -materi -groundflow, NO groundflow_pressure
  unknown (manual Professional 6.574).
  Analytic effective sigyy (the stress dofs hold the effective stress):
    above the level (dry):  -1.5*10*(0-y)
    below the level:        -750 - (2.0-1.0)*10*(-50-y)
  so -1250 at the bottom. The element stresses are constant per element
  and the nodal value is the average of the adjacent elements, so the
  bottom node holds the value of the bottom element centre y=-99.75:
  -750 - 10*49.75 = -1247.5 (exact for this mesh), and the node on the
  level holds (-746.25 - 752.5)/2 = -749.375. Static total pressure at
  the bottom: 1*(-10)*(-50+100) = -500.
  Pro 02-08-2026: -1247.5, -749.375, -500. Pre-fix GNU: bottom -1995
  (wet density over the whole column, no pore pressure). Without the
  pore pressure only: -1745; without the wet/dry choice only: -1497.5.
  The post_calcul -total_pressure record is also needed by the
  Professional, which applies the static pore pressure to the skeleton
  only when that record is present. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia

start_define
  eps_geometry  1.e-5
end_define

start_define
  right_edge geometry_line 1
end_define
right_edge 1. -100. 1. 0. eps_geometry

start_define
  left_edge geometry_line 2
end_define
left_edge 0. -100. 0. 0. eps_geometry

start_define
  lower_edge geometry_line 3
end_define
lower_edge 0. -100. 1. -100. eps_geometry

bounda_dof  10  -left_edge -velx
bounda_dof  20  -right_edge -velx
bounda_dof  30  -lower_edge -velx -vely

control_mesh_macro              0 -rectangle 0 2 201
control_mesh_macro_parameters   0  0.5 -50. 1. 100.

force_gravity 0. -10.

groundflow_density 1.
groundflow_phreatic_level   -50.
groundflow_phreatic_level_static   -yes

group_type 0  -materi -groundflow
group_materi_density_groundflow 0  2.0 1.5
group_materi_elasti_young 0  1.0e6
group_materi_memory 0  -total_linear

post_calcul -groundflow_pressure -total_pressure
post_point  1  0.5 -100.
post_point  2  0.5 -50.

control_timestep   10  1. 1.
control_timestep_iterations 10 5

target_item  0   -post_point_dof 1 -sigyy
target_value 0   -1247.5 1.e-2
target_item  1   -post_point_dof 2 -sigyy
target_value 1   -749.375 1.e-2
target_item  2   -post_point_dof_calcul 1 0
target_value 2   -500.0 1.e-2
end_data
